OL,3,GNEWSA'Non-stop clanking outside our
OL,4,Ahouse is driving us mad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe constant clanking of a faulty
OL,7,Fmanhole cover as it is driven over by
OL,8,Fcars has kept residents awake all night
OL,9,Ffor more than a year, they say.
OL,11,FMike and Angie Yates, who live near the
OL,12,Fmanhole cover on Drews Holloway - a
OL,13,Fmain road between Halesowen and
OL,14,FStourbridge in the West Midlands - said
OL,15,Fthey had endured months of persistent
OL,16,Fnoise.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
