OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1790704544
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Non-stop clanking outside our
OL,4,Ahouse is driving us mad'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the BBC measured noise at the
OL,7,Fsite, they found it rose to more than
OL,8,F90 decibels when vehicles drove over
OL,9,Fthe manhole cover - a level that, with
OL,10,Fprolonged exposure, can cause hearing
OL,11,Floss.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for water company Severn
OL,14,FTrent, which is responsible for the
OL,15,Fmanhole cover, said necessary works
OL,16,Fwould be completed "as soon as
OL,17,Fpossible".
